    "proof_markdown": "# tangential-quadrilateral-second-tangent-circle-tangency 適用証明\n\n## 判定\n\n- 構成依存関係と目標を照合した。\n- 座標チャート上の全恒等式を厳密再生した。\n- 判定: `proved`（構成の定義域条件まで消去済み）。\n- 問題確認後に実装したチャートなので、凍結未見得点には遡及加算しない。\n\n## 入力問題\n\n```text\nt1 t2 t3 = triangle; i = circumcenter t1 t2 t3; t4 = on_circle i t1; a = on_tline t1 i t1, on_tline t2 i t2; b = on_tline t2 i t2, on_tline t3 i t3; c = on_tline t3 i t3, on_tline t4 i t4; d = on_tline t1 i t1, on_tline t4 i t4; t5 = on_circle i t1, on_tline i a c; p = on_tline t5 i t5, on_line b d; t = reflect t5 i p; o = circumcenter a t c ? coll i o t\n```\n\n## 点の役割対応\n\n- `A` -> `a`\n- `B` -> `b`\n- `C` -> `c`\n- `D` -> `d`\n- `I` -> `i`\n- `O` -> `o`\n- `P` -> `p`\n- `S` -> `t5`\n- `T` -> `t`\n- `U1` -> `t1`\n- `U2` -> `t2`\n- `U3` -> `t3`\n- `U4` -> `t4`\n\n## 非退化条件\n\n- `the four side tangents and the two tangents from P have finite intersections`\n- `the tangent at S and BD have a unique finite intersection P`\n- `A, T, and C are noncollinear so their circumcenter exists`\n- `all selected circle and line intersections are real and nondegenerate`\n\n## 未消去条件\n\n- なし\n\n## 証明書\n\n- SHA-256: `e506a826c1ab3d43139fa2d051083040c77648c342413ed9c503d7fd3da00352`\n- 再生恒等式: `20`\n\n# Tangential quadrilateral second-tangent chart\n\n## Theorem\n\nLet ABCD be formed by four tangents to a circle with centre I. A tangent parallel to AC meets BD at P and touches the circle at S. If the other tangent from P touches at T, then the circumcircle of ATC is tangent to the original circle at T.\n\n## Exact elimination certificate\n\n`K^2*H + (p-q)^2*(p-r)*(q-w)*(r-w)^2*F = Q*G`\n\nHere F is the parallel-tangent constraint, G is P on BD, H is the centre-collinearity numerator, and K is the coefficient of v in G.\n\n## Replayed identities\n\n- `A_on_tangent_p`: `0`\n- `A_on_tangent_q`: `0`\n- `B_on_tangent_q`: `0`\n- `B_on_tangent_r`: `0`\n- `C_on_tangent_r`: `0`\n- `C_on_tangent_w`: `0`\n- `D_on_tangent_w`: `0`\n- `D_on_tangent_p`: `0`\n- `S_on_unit_circle`: `0`\n- `T_on_unit_circle`: `0`\n- `P_on_tangent_at_S`: `0`\n- `P_on_tangent_at_T`: `0`\n- `reflection_S_to_T_x`: `0`\n- `reflection_S_to_T_y`: `0`\n- `parallel_constraint_reconstruction`: `0`\n- `BD_constraint_reconstruction`: `0`\n- `G_is_linear_in_v`: `0`\n- `polynomial_elimination_remainder`: `0`\n- `generic_cramer_collinearity_bridge`: `0`\n- `unit_circle_specialization_bridge`: `0`\n\n- quotient terms: `126`\n- quotient SHA-256: `cd32765bcd7f238ecf9b4c682e286ae7fa486675b28be8817c35af8cdcbef3dd`\n- all identities replayed: `True`\n- all domain conditions discharged: `True`\n- certificate SHA-256: `e506a826c1ab3d43139fa2d051083040c77648c342413ed9c503d7fd3da00352`\n",
